# KiCad/editor working files and intermediate autorouter exports -
# regenerated by build_schematic.py/build_pcb.py/route_board.py, not
# hand-authored source. Same convention as the sibling ecu-pcb/thermo-pcb
# projects.
*.dsn
*.ses
*.lck
.history/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
fp-info-cache
*.kicad_pcb-bak
*.kicad_sch-bak

# Third-party tool binary (FreeRouting, ~57MB), not project-specific
# code - see README for the real download requirement instead of
# committing a large third-party jar.
tools/*.jar

# Vendor datasheets pulled down for pinout extraction. These are
# Toradex's/NXP's documents, not this project's source - tools/
# extract_verdin_pinout.py takes the local path as an argument so the
# PDF never needs committing.
*.pdf

# generic
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# KiCad local editor state and generated ERC reports - regenerated,
# not source.
*.kicad_prl
*-erc.rpt
